# Graphify corpus boundary for this repository.
#
# The session-start refresh runs `graphify update`, which re-extracts code files
# without an LLM. Anything left in the corpus that only a semantic extraction can
# index therefore stays pending after every free refresh, and the provider adapter
# rejects an incomplete index rather than trusting it. Keeping the corpus to what
# `update` can rebuild is what lets the graph return to complete on its own.
*.md
*.yaml
*.yml
*.txt
*.html
*.svg
*.png
